      "origin": {
        "handoffEntry": "MIK-R39@v1-other-selections-start-afresh",
        "leaf": "260928-MIK-L39"
      },
      "rationale": "Folds one answer into the walk. An answer whose comparison is not the walk's, and the first answer after an outside selection, replace every family the walk held. The notice that the walk started again is set only when another comparison dropped kept families.",
      "role": "enforcement"
    },
    {
